<h4>Jenkins Pipelines</h4>
<table style="marginTop15 marginBot15">
	<tr>
		<td>
			<ul>
				<li>Initial Analysering</li>
				- App type ; web app, microservice, monolith
				- Language & frameworks
				- Source code hosted hvor ?
				<br />
				- Build tools ; Gradle, npm, Docker
				- Håndtering af Testing ; unit, integration, test-tools som JUnit, PyTest ?
				- Stages ; Linting, code coverage, sikkerheds-scanning
				<br />
				- Deployment ; Cloud, container eller on-premise (physical)
				- IaC elementer

				<li>Efterfølgende Evaluering</li>
				- Simpel freestyle setup vs. fleksibilitet i scripted
				- Multi-branch ift. feature-branching
				- Multiple SCMs vs singular
				<br />
				- Multiple stages / expanding / varying
				- Integration med eksterne services
				<br />
				- Pipeline-as-Code
				- Potentielt delte libraries
			</ul>
		</td>
	</tr>
</table>

